# "A Room you control": Bot2's Bottomless Pool (cast on turn 2 with a Mox Sapphire) is not Bot1's, so on turn 3, when Bot1 unlocks Central Elevator (Black
# Lotus and a Mox Sapphire), the Bottomless Pool // Locker Room card in Bot1's library may still be found; Bot1 takes it (library 13 -> 12 for the draw
# step -> 11); the Pool card, three cards down, is not the draw.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Central Elevator // Promising Stairs
Island x4
Island x3
Bottomless Pool // Locker Room
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Bottomless Pool // Locker Room
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Bottomless Pool // Locker Room.Cast(Ability: Bottomless Pool)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Bottomless Pool.Doors = Bottomless Pool
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Central Elevator // Promising Stairs.Cast(Ability: Central Elevator)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Bottomless Pool // Locker Room)
? Bot1.Library.Count = 11
[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Bottomless Pool // Locker Room
